{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304520","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304520","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1530452001:1":{"text":"何がダメなんだ？狩猟神がいた頃なら、そりゃあ無理だけど。","source_cn":"为什么不行，之前狩猎神还在的时候当然不可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3769335268CBB595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530452002:1":{"text":"狩猟神が倒れた今、もはや俺に罰を与えることもできないだろ？","source_cn":"不过她现在陨落了，应该不会惩罚我了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC23151ED6E7B2CE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530452003:1":{"text":"お前には信仰心というものがないのか？","source_cn":"你就不能虔诚专一一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA7D833128FF9D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1530452004:1":{"text":"だからその信仰する神がいないんだって。忠誠を尽くしたところで、もう狩りも助けてくれない……","source_cn":"对狩猎神虔诚有什么用？狩猎的时候她也不会帮助我们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA06EA140631B3C76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士吞":{"text":"戦士のスワロウ","source":"战士吞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:战士强腕":{"text":"戦士のパワアーム","source":"战士强腕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}